<rtept lat="52.1076200000" lon="0.7954700000">
<time>2025-09-04T11:04:53Z</time>
<name>Start to Bears Barn</name>
<desc>Walk up Church Street, away from the High Street.  Cross the road and after 120 metres, turn left into Bear Lane.  Follow this tarmac road past housing and out of Lavenham.  Ignore various footpath signs tempting you to go right - you will see more wildlife on the lane.  Continue past Weaners Farm and you come to a five-bar gate where the lane enters a private garden.  A footpath sign points left, to a fenced path.</desc>
